sequenceDiagram

participant Client
participant Validator
participant Registry
participant Terminology
participant Mapper
participant Comparator

Client->>Validator: Submit FHIR Resource

Validator->>Registry: Load Metadata
Registry-->>Validator: Resource Definition

Validator->>Registry: Load Profile
Registry-->>Validator: Profile

Validator->>Terminology: Validate Codes
Terminology-->>Validator: Validation Result

Validator->>Mapper: Validate Mapping

Mapper->>Registry: Resolve Mapping
Registry-->>Mapper: Mapping Config

Mapper-->>Validator: Mapping Valid

Validator->>Mapper: Transform Resource

Mapper-->>Validator: Output Resource

Validator->>Comparator: Compare Output

Comparator-->>Validator: Differences

Validator-->>Client: Validation Report
